==Description==
The '''Korblox Soul''' was an enemy that appeared in [[The Classic Event]]. It had a decent amount of health and above average speed. Additionally, it was a [[Hidden (Attribute)|Hidden]] enemy, while on some waves, also a [[Lead (Attribute)|Lead]] enemy, reducing the amount of towers that could kill it.

==Appearance==
The '''Korblox Soul''' had blue skin. It did not have a head, torso or legs, though it did have a rib cage. It wore a grey helmet, grey cloth around waist and had chains wrapped around its arms. It also had multiple blue spikes on its shoulders.

==Strategy==
*The [[Militant]] and [[Golden Soldier]] can be quite effective against the '''Korblox Soul''', as they have cheap hidden detection and are capable of killing it while it is a tank.
*Towers like the [[Minigunner]], [[Engineer]] or [[Accelerator]] can be effective at clearing these out at later waves.
**Do note that the [[Engineer]] does not get hidden detection on its sentries until Level 5, which can make it struggle against the '''Korblox Soul''' when it is a tank.
*The [[Commander]] can be quite useful if available, as it can allow your towers to deal more damage to the '''Korblox Soul''', which can be useful when it is a tank.

